in Cloud Composer.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.430
And this way, it benefit from
a fully managed environment.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.630
Now, it seems this is a
fully managed environment.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.510
There are some features
that distinguish it

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.940
from a self-managed
Apache Airflow.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:55.980
And I would like to
spend just a minute

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:58.350
to call these features
out so that we

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.808
understand how they differ.

00:00:59.808 --> 00:01:01.350
And then we're going
to dive directly

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.540
